{
  "about": "Motion 2: spin, sway and the appearance of a node (schema 9.40.0). Numbers are computed independently of the reference implementation. Angles are degrees, clockwise positive; the appearance shift is logical pixels down.",
  "turnNote": "spin: rotate = s * 360 * ((t - delay) mod duration) / duration, s = +1 clockwise; sway: rotate = angle * sin(theta), mirrored in right-to-left; pivot — the point of the box the turn is about; rest — rotate 0.",
